    "claim": "Scene 096988dd also failed at a quite different setting (car 0.5 s late at 2x speed, ego at recorded speed), the same way: a left drift into actor 41. That was a single run, so it is a hint, not a rate. It suggests this scene's weakness depends little on the exact knob values. It does not add a distinct confirmed case.",
    "settings": [
     "S5",
     "S4"
